 387: 
 388: | Finding | Change in revision 2 |
 389: |---|---|
 390: | Peer 1: invisible FEN move counters changed supersession | Diary stores the delivered input, not board text; supersession by input hash; stage 0 check 3 |
 391: | Peer 2: existing teaching path selects moves by certificate, has no receipts, and delivers input and pulse in one pass | Section 4.1 lesson boundary; one-pass delivery; auditor recomputes every replay; teacher-chosen tape disclosed for stage 2 only |
 392: | Peer 3: stage 1 cannot be copied as written | Stage 1 contract: adapter, six seeds, injected codes, recomputed prediction-scaled teaching, complete state, per-seed rules, original medians reported; mixed-order arm removed from stage 1 |
 393: | Peer 4 and skeptic 2: moved-timing arm dropped new-block replays; own-choice arms see different lessons | Moved timing keeps every replay; stage 2 uses one fixed tape; dopamine factors and update sizes logged; feedback-cut descriptive arm |
 394: | Peer 4 and skeptic 5: lookup and simple learner unspecified | Exact case-recall and learner rules; nonlinear random-feature learner added |
 395: | Peer 5: scores and sampling not uniquely computable | All-legal measure with unknowns, ties, king moves and ineligible boards defined; Algorithm R and random streams; chi-square scheme; game manifest and worked examples required before launch |
 396: | Skeptic 1: margins hide losses; refresh rival; all-legal had no threshold | Kept-share rule; low-point snapshots and sawtooth log; all-legal threshold |
